flowchart TB
    subgraph CONTROL[平台侧：确定配置与使用范围]
        direction LR
        HTTP[HTTP 入口<br/>用户身份 + Agent 选择] --> RES[ModelResolver<br/>归属、范围、启用检查]
        RES --> FAC[ModelFactory<br/>选择模型创建函数]
        DB[(供应商与 Agent 配置)] -. 读取 .-> RES
        SEC[凭据服务<br/>按引用取 Key] -. 后端读取 .-> FAC
    end
    subgraph RUNTIME[运行时：复用已有模型与 Agent 能力]
        direction LR
        SDK[厂商 SDK / 模型适配器] --> MODEL[统一模型对象]
        MODEL --> AGENT[DeepAgents<br/>计划与工具调用]
    end
    CONTROL -->|注入已选择的模型| RUNTIME
    RUNTIME --> API[模型服务 API<br/>返回任务所需的响应]
    classDef entry fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#6366f1,color:#172554;
    classDef control fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b;
    classDef adapter fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#ea580c,color:#7c2d12;
    class HTTP,AGENT entry;
    class RES,DB,FAC,SEC control;
    class SDK,MODEL,API adapter;
